<title>USA: TABLE - Coleman Co Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coleman Co Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kansas 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 10,119		   27,399</p>
<p> Revs		     383,514		  452,654</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,338		   53,190</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.20		    $0.80</p>
<p> Net			 10,818		   42,438</p>
<p> Revs		     678,978		  726,214</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  53,285		   53,178</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 and six months include extraordinary loss $0.01 per share.  </p>
<p>Current Q2 after $18.6 million in costs for restructuring and rationalization programs.</p>
<p>Programs to reduce wholesaler inventories in Japan reduced earnings per share by about $0.06 per share in 1997 Q2 and six months.</p>
</text>
